⚡🇯🇵 Magnitude 7.1 earthquake strikes Kyushu, southern Japan.

Epicenter near Kumamoto, hypocenter at a depth of 10 km. A tsunami warning has been issued for the Ariake and Yatsushiro seas.

@medmannews

⚡🇮🇱🇱🇧 Israeli Army Radio: The IDF has reduced reserve troops in a sensitive operational zone along the Lebanese border by nearly 30%.

The battalion commander sent an urgent letter to senior leadership warning: "We face a severe manpower crisis affecting our ability to fulfill our operational duties."

@medmannews
